       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             SPMEXPND.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
      *REMARKS.                PREVENTIVE MAINTENANCE FIXED-DATE
      *                        AND CALENDAR RELEASE PROGRAMS.
      *                        EXPAND MONTHS DISPLAY PROGRAM.
      *                        ****.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                      LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN       TO WORKSTATION-ZPMMAINT-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS MODE  IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS  IS SCREEN-STATUS
                               MAJOR-MINOR
                  CONTROL-AREA IS SCREEN-CONTROL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC         PIC X(2000).
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  SUB                 PIC 9(04)  VALUE 0 COMP.
       77  HELP-SW             PIC 9(04)  VALUE 0.
       77  ERR-SW              PIC X(01)  VALUE "N".
       77  SAVE-MONTH          PIC X(06)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  LINK-MONTH          PIC X(06)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  MO-NAME             PIC X(09)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  MO-ERROR            PIC X(76)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  TRUE-VAL            PIC 1     VALUE B"1".

       01  FILE-STAT.
           05 FILE-STAT-1      PIC X   VALUE "0".
           05 FILE-STAT-2      PIC X   VALUE "0".

       01  INSTR-LINE           PIC X(78) VALUE "  F1-QUARTER BKRD   F2-
      -    "QUARTER FWRD   F3/F8-EXIT   F5-YEAR BKWD   F6-YEAR FWRD".

       01  SCREEN-DATA.
           05  SD-M1           PIC X(10).
           05  SD-M1Y1         PIC X(04).
           05  SD-M2           PIC X(10).
           05  SD-M2Y2         PIC X(04).
           05  SD-M3           PIC X(10).
           05  SD-M3Y3         PIC X(04).
           05  SD-M1W1         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M2W1         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M3W1         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M1W2         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M2W2         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M3W2         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M1W3         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M2W3         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M3W3         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M1W4         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M2W4         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M3W4         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M1W5         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M2W5         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M3W5         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M1W6         PIC X(06).
           05  SD-M2W6         PIC X(06).
           05  SD-M3W6         PIC X(06).
           05  SD-M4           PIC X(10).
           05  SD-M4Y4         PIC X(04).
           05  SD-M5           PIC X(10).
           05  SD-M5Y5         PIC X(04).
           05  SD-M6           PIC X(10).
           05  SD-M6Y6         PIC X(04).
           05  SD-M4W1         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M5W1         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M6W1         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M4W2         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M5W2         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M6W2         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M4W3         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M5W3         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M6W3         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M4W4         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M5W4         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M6W4         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M4W5         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M5W5         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M6W5         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M4W6         PIC X(06).
           05  SD-M5W6         PIC X(06).
           05  SD-M6W6         PIC X(06).
           05  SD-M7           PIC X(10).
           05  SD-M7Y7         PIC X(04).
           05  SD-M8           PIC X(10).
           05  SD-M8Y8         PIC X(04).
           05  SD-M9           PIC X(10).
           05  SD-M9Y9         PIC X(04).
           05  SD-M7W1         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M8W1         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M9W1         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M7W2         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M8W2         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M9W2         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M7W3         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M8W3         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M9W3         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M7W4         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M8W4         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M9W4         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M7W5         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M8W5         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M9W5         PIC X(20).
           05  SD-M7W6         PIC X(06).
           05  SD-M8W6         PIC X(06).
           05  SD-M9W6         PIC X(06).
           05  ERRMSG          PIC X(79).

       01  MO-DATA.
           05  WEEK-1          PIC X(21).
           05  WEEK-2          PIC X(21).
           05  WEEK-3          PIC X(21).
           05  WEEK-4          PIC X(21).
           05  WEEK-5          PIC X(21).
           05  WEEK-6          PIC X(06).

       01  YEAR-MONTH.
           05 YEAR-MON.
               10 YEAR-MON-X.
                   15  YM-YEAR PIC X(04).
                   15  YM-MONTH PIC X(02).
               10 YEAR-MON-9   REDEFINES YEAR-MON-X.
                   15  YM-YR   PIC 9(04).
                   15  YM-YRB  REDEFINES YM-YR.
                       20  YMYR3 PIC 9(03).
                       20  YMYRL PIC 9.
                   15  YM-MON  PIC 9(02).

       COPY IOFEEDBACK         IN COPYLIB.

       COPY SCREENIO           IN COPYLIB.

       01  MESSAGE-DATA.
           COPY ERRORLIN       IN COPYLIB.

       01  VMONTHS.
           COPY DD-VMONTHS     IN ZPMMAINT.

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LINK-DATA.
           05 LINK-EQUIP       PIC X(06).
           05 LINK-WONUM       PIC X(10).
           05 LINK-ZONE-PRI    PIC X(06).
           05 LINK-YRMO.
               10 LINK-DATA-X.
                   15  LD-YEAR PIC X(04).
                   15  LD-MONTH PIC X(02).
               10 LINK-DATA-9  REDEFINES LINK-DATA-X.
                   15  LD-YR   PIC 9(04).
                   15  LD-YRB  REDEFINES LD-YR.
                       20  LDYR3 PIC 9(03).
                       20  LDYRL PIC 9.
                   15  LD-MON  PIC 9(02).

       01  DBPARAMETERS.
           COPY DBPARMS        IN COPYLIB.

           COPY VCOMLINK       IN COPYLIB.

           COPY LANGSUB        IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION      USING LINK-DATA
                               DBPARAMETERS
                               VIEW-COMAREA
                               LANGUAGE-PARMS.
       START-PROGRAM.
           PERFORM 1-HOUSEKEEPING THRU 1-EXIT.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN         THRU 6-EXIT.
           PERFORM 2-END-OF-JOB   THRU 2-EXIT.

       1-HOUSEKEEPING.
           OPEN I-O            DISPLAY-FILE.
           MOVE LINK-YRMO      TO LINK-MONTH SAVE-MONTH.
           MOVE 0              TO VIEW-STATUS.
           MOVE SPACES         TO SCREEN-DATA MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           MOVE INSTR-LINE     TO ERRMSG.
           PERFORM 60-GET-SCREEN-DATA THRU 60-GSD-EXIT.

       1-EXIT.                 EXIT.

       2-END-OF-JOB.
           MOVE LINK-MONTH     TO LINK-YRMO.
           CLOSE               DISPLAY-FILE.
           GOBACK.

       2-EXIT.
           EXIT.

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "VMONTHS"      TO SCREEN-NAME.
           MOVE SCREEN-DATA    TO VMONTHS-O.
           MOVE VMONTHS        TO DISPLAY-REC.

       SHOWFORM.
           PERFORM 99-SCREEN-WRITE THRU 99-EXIT.
           PERFORM 98-SCREEN-READ  THRU 98-EXIT.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO VMONTHS.
           IF ERR-SW = "Y"
               MOVE INSTR-LINE TO ERRMSG
               MOVE "N"        TO ERR-SW.

           IF KEY-HIT = 3 OR 8
               GO TO 6-EXIT.

           IF KEY-HIT = 1
               MOVE SAVE-MONTH TO YEAR-MON
               PERFORM 64-SUBTRACT-MONTH 3 TIMES
               MOVE YEAR-MON   TO SAVE-MONTH
               PERFORM 60-GET-SCREEN-DATA THRU 60-GSD-EXIT
               IF ERR-SW = "Y"
                   MOVE SAVE-MONTH TO YEAR-MON
                   PERFORM 63-ADD-MONTH 3 TIMES
                   MOVE YEAR-MON TO SAVE-MONTH
                   PERFORM 60-GET-SCREEN-DATA THRU 60-GSD-EXIT
                   GO TO 6-MAIN
               ELSE
                   GO TO 6-MAIN.

           IF KEY-HIT = 2
               MOVE SAVE-MONTH TO YEAR-MON
               PERFORM 63-ADD-MONTH 3 TIMES
               MOVE YEAR-MON   TO SAVE-MONTH
               PERFORM 60-GET-SCREEN-DATA THRU 60-GSD-EXIT
               IF ERR-SW = "Y"
                   MOVE SAVE-MONTH TO YEAR-MON
                   PERFORM 64-SUBTRACT-MONTH 3 TIMES
                   MOVE YEAR-MON TO SAVE-MONTH
                   PERFORM 60-GET-SCREEN-DATA THRU 60-GSD-EXIT
                   GO TO 6-MAIN
               ELSE
                   GO TO 6-MAIN.

           IF KEY-HIT = 5
               MOVE SAVE-MONTH TO YEAR-MON
               PERFORM 64-SUBTRACT-MONTH 9 TIMES
               MOVE YEAR-MON   TO SAVE-MONTH
               PERFORM 60-GET-SCREEN-DATA THRU 60-GSD-EXIT
               IF ERR-SW = "Y"
                   MOVE SAVE-MONTH TO YEAR-MON
                   PERFORM 63-ADD-MONTH 9 TIMES
                   MOVE YEAR-MON   TO SAVE-MONTH
                   PERFORM 60-GET-SCREEN-DATA THRU 60-GSD-EXIT
                   GO TO 6-MAIN
               ELSE
                   GO TO 6-MAIN.

           IF KEY-HIT = 6
               MOVE SAVE-MONTH TO YEAR-MON
               PERFORM 63-ADD-MONTH 9 TIMES
               MOVE YEAR-MON   TO SAVE-MONTH
               PERFORM 60-GET-SCREEN-DATA THRU 60-GSD-EXIT
               IF ERR-SW = "Y"
                   MOVE SAVE-MONTH TO YEAR-MON
                   PERFORM 64-SUBTRACT-MONTH 9 TIMES
                   MOVE YEAR-MON TO SAVE-MONTH
                   PERFORM 60-GET-SCREEN-DATA THRU 60-GSD-EXIT
                   GO TO 6-MAIN
               ELSE
                   GO TO 6-MAIN.

           IF KEY-HIT = 7
               MOVE 406        TO HELP-SW
               CALL "SPMHELPM" USING HELP-SW
               GO TO 6-MAIN.

           GO TO SHOWFORM.

       6-EXIT.                 EXIT.

       60-GET-SCREEN-DATA.
           MOVE SAVE-MONTH     TO YEAR-MON.
           PERFORM 61-GET-MONTH-DATA.
           PERFORM 62-LOAD-MONTH-5.
           PERFORM 64-SUBTRACT-MONTH.
           PERFORM 61-GET-MONTH-DATA.
           PERFORM 62-LOAD-MONTH-4.
           PERFORM 64-SUBTRACT-MONTH.
           PERFORM 61-GET-MONTH-DATA.
           PERFORM 62-LOAD-MONTH-3.
           PERFORM 64-SUBTRACT-MONTH.
           PERFORM 61-GET-MONTH-DATA.
           PERFORM 62-LOAD-MONTH-2.
           PERFORM 64-SUBTRACT-MONTH.
           PERFORM 61-GET-MONTH-DATA.
           PERFORM 62-LOAD-MONTH-1.
           MOVE SAVE-MONTH     TO YEAR-MON.
           PERFORM 63-ADD-MONTH.
           PERFORM 61-GET-MONTH-DATA.
           PERFORM 62-LOAD-MONTH-6.
           PERFORM 63-ADD-MONTH.
           PERFORM 61-GET-MONTH-DATA.
           PERFORM 62-LOAD-MONTH-7.
           PERFORM 63-ADD-MONTH.
           PERFORM 61-GET-MONTH-DATA.
           PERFORM 62-LOAD-MONTH-8.
           PERFORM 63-ADD-MONTH.
           PERFORM 61-GET-MONTH-DATA.
           PERFORM 62-LOAD-MONTH-9.

       60-GSD-EXIT.            EXIT.

       61-GET-MONTH-DATA.
           CALL "CALENDAR"     USING YEAR-MONTH
                               MO-NAME
                               MO-DATA
                               MO-ERROR.
           IF ERR-SW = "N"
             IF MO-ERROR NOT = SPACES
               MOVE MO-ERROR   TO ERRMSG
               MOVE "Y"        TO ERR-SW
               GO TO 60-GSD-EXIT.

       61-GMD-EXIT.            EXIT.

       62-LOAD-MONTH-1.
           MOVE MO-NAME        TO SD-M1.
           MOVE YM-YEAR        TO SD-M1Y1.
           MOVE WEEK-1         TO SD-M1W1.
           MOVE WEEK-2         TO SD-M1W2.
           MOVE WEEK-3         TO SD-M1W3.
           MOVE WEEK-4         TO SD-M1W4.
           MOVE WEEK-5         TO SD-M1W5.
           MOVE WEEK-6         TO SD-M1W6.

       62-LOAD-MONTH-2.
           MOVE MO-NAME        TO SD-M2.
           MOVE YM-YEAR        TO SD-M2Y2.
           MOVE WEEK-1         TO SD-M2W1.
           MOVE WEEK-2         TO SD-M2W2.
           MOVE WEEK-3         TO SD-M2W3.
           MOVE WEEK-4         TO SD-M2W4.
           MOVE WEEK-5         TO SD-M2W5.
           MOVE WEEK-6         TO SD-M2W6.

       62-LOAD-MONTH-3.
           MOVE MO-NAME        TO SD-M3.
           MOVE YM-YEAR        TO SD-M3Y3.
           MOVE WEEK-1         TO SD-M3W1.
           MOVE WEEK-2         TO SD-M3W2.
           MOVE WEEK-3         TO SD-M3W3.
           MOVE WEEK-4         TO SD-M3W4.
           MOVE WEEK-5         TO SD-M3W5.
           MOVE WEEK-6         TO SD-M3W6.

       62-LOAD-MONTH-4.
           MOVE MO-NAME        TO SD-M4.
           MOVE YM-YEAR        TO SD-M4Y4.
           MOVE WEEK-1         TO SD-M4W1.
           MOVE WEEK-2         TO SD-M4W2.
           MOVE WEEK-3         TO SD-M4W3.
           MOVE WEEK-4         TO SD-M4W4.
           MOVE WEEK-5         TO SD-M4W5.
           MOVE WEEK-6         TO SD-M4W6.

       62-LOAD-MONTH-5.
           MOVE MO-NAME        TO SD-M5.
           MOVE YM-YEAR        TO SD-M5Y5.
           MOVE WEEK-1         TO SD-M5W1.
           MOVE WEEK-2         TO SD-M5W2.
           MOVE WEEK-3         TO SD-M5W3.
           MOVE WEEK-4         TO SD-M5W4.
           MOVE WEEK-5         TO SD-M5W5.
           MOVE WEEK-6         TO SD-M5W6.

       62-LOAD-MONTH-6.
           MOVE MO-NAME        TO SD-M6.
           MOVE YM-YEAR        TO SD-M6Y6.
           MOVE WEEK-1         TO SD-M6W1.
           MOVE WEEK-2         TO SD-M6W2.
           MOVE WEEK-3         TO SD-M6W3.
           MOVE WEEK-4         TO SD-M6W4.
           MOVE WEEK-5         TO SD-M6W5.
           MOVE WEEK-6         TO SD-M6W6.

       62-LOAD-MONTH-7.
           MOVE MO-NAME        TO SD-M7.
           MOVE YM-YEAR        TO SD-M7Y7.
           MOVE WEEK-1         TO SD-M7W1.
           MOVE WEEK-2         TO SD-M7W2.
           MOVE WEEK-3         TO SD-M7W3.
           MOVE WEEK-4         TO SD-M7W4.
           MOVE WEEK-5         TO SD-M7W5.
           MOVE WEEK-6         TO SD-M7W6.

       62-LOAD-MONTH-8.
           MOVE MO-NAME        TO SD-M8.
           MOVE YM-YEAR        TO SD-M8Y8.
           MOVE WEEK-1         TO SD-M8W1.
           MOVE WEEK-2         TO SD-M8W2.
           MOVE WEEK-3         TO SD-M8W3.
           MOVE WEEK-4         TO SD-M8W4.
           MOVE WEEK-5         TO SD-M8W5.
           MOVE WEEK-6         TO SD-M8W6.

       62-LOAD-MONTH-9.
           MOVE MO-NAME        TO SD-M9.
           MOVE YM-YEAR        TO SD-M9Y9.
           MOVE WEEK-1         TO SD-M9W1.
           MOVE WEEK-2         TO SD-M9W2.
           MOVE WEEK-3         TO SD-M9W3.
           MOVE WEEK-4         TO SD-M9W4.
           MOVE WEEK-5         TO SD-M9W5.
           MOVE WEEK-6         TO SD-M9W6.

       63-ADD-MONTH.
           ADD 1               TO YM-MON.
           IF YM-MON > 12
               MOVE 1          TO YM-MON
               ADD  1          TO YM-YR.
           MOVE SPACES         TO MO-ERROR.

       64-SUBTRACT-MONTH.
           SUBTRACT 1          FROM YM-MON.
           IF YM-MON < 1
               MOVE 12         TO YM-MON
               SUBTRACT 1      FROM YM-YR.
           MOVE SPACES         TO MO-ERROR.

       98-SCREEN-READ.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE   FORMAT IS SCREEN-NAME
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS
           ACCEPT IOFEEDBACK FROM I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN READ ERROR.  SCREEN-STATUS = "
                               SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO 2-END-OF-JOB.

       98-EXIT.                EXIT.

       98A-SCREEN-READ.
           READ DISPLAY-FILE   TERMINAL IS TERMINAL-ID
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS
                   NO DATA MOVE SCREEN-STATUS TO SCREEN-STATUS.
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN READ ERROR.  SCREEN-STATUS = "
                               SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO 2-END-OF-JOB.

       98A-EXIT.               EXIT.

       99-SCREEN-WRITE.
           WRITE DISPLAY-REC   FORMAT IS SCREEN-NAME
               INDIC ARE SCREEN-INDICATORS.
           IF SCREEN-STATUS NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "SCREEN WRITE ERROR.  SCREEN-STATIS = "
                               SCREEN-STATUS
               GO TO 2-END-OF-JOB.

       99-EXIT.                EXIT.

      ********************  END OF PROGRAM  -  SPMEXPND  **********************
